{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tales Beyond the Tomb is a psychological horror anthology inspired by disturbing real-life cases, each episode a self-contained nightmare with its own cast, tone, and aesthetic. Dive into short, intense stories where fear hits fast \u2014 and stays with you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860920/extras/d00493134f92fe1abb61810fc5e537d5.poster.avif?t=1756194604\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860920/extras/d00493134f92fe1abb61810fc5e537d5.webm?t=1756194604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860920/extras/d00493134f92fe1abb61810fc5e537d5.mp4?t=1756194604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tales Beyond The Tomb: Route 86</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five friends hit the road in search of fun, freedom\u2026 and maybe a little trouble. But an unexpected stop takes them to a remote location, where evil doesn\u2019t just lurk in the shadows \u2014 it wears human skin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by cult <i>trash horror</i> films from the '80s and '90s, <i>Route 86</i> plunges players into a bloody, nerve-wracking night full of tension, chases, violence, and desperate decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Route 86</i> is a first-person narrative experience with a focus on <strong>exploration</strong>, <strong>stealth</strong>, and <strong>psychological immersion</strong>. The game is structured in short chapters, switching perspectives between different members of the group as they face the horrors of the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Microphone input can be enabled, letting enemies hear your real-life breathing and voice \u2014 if you dare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-person cinematic horror</strong>: Play as different characters, each with unique scenes and moments of tension.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration and stealth</strong>: Investigate the environment, hide under furniture or inside closets, and avoid being seen or heard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optional microphone support</strong>: Enemies will hear you if you make noise in real life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dubbing</strong>: Character voice acting and text dialogue system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50 to 90 minutes of gameplay</strong>, divided into chapters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gore-heavy and disturbing content</strong>: Includes graphic violence and horror themes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full support for PS4/Xbox controllers</strong> and active vibration system.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"EP5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3860920/470e098c350541a463429204a08859da908d859e.jpg"},{"name":"Balloons","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3860920/41871b98c1b7d0059164cc4528ea15a57d5a0922.jpg"},{"name":"Trauma","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3860920/a717110c59909cc5150ebd44cfaa138ac0c1143b.jpg"},{"name":"Cold blood","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3860920/6ecb64224310cb2f26c18c7dd984066de2ec3057.jpg"},{"name":"Pig Face","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3860920/8d47d332ba40911c25bb2b5fd582fdaa07e84ed6.jpg"},{"name":"Gore","path":"https://cdn.akamai.stea